Gemma 4 E4B WebGPU encoder

This file is derived from the Gemma 4 E4B vision encoder by Google DeepMind.
The original model and this derivative are provided under the Apache License
2.0. A copy is in MODEL_LICENSE.

Overshoot modified the model by exporting the vision encoder to a fixed-shape
FP16 ONNX graph, selecting the pre-projector [1, 264, 768] output, and applying
RMSNorm, RoPE, FastGELU, and MatMul+Clip graph fusions for ONNX Runtime WebGPU.

